---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | EV Kelly Calculator"
  description="Review the terms of service and financial liability disclaimers for using the EV Kelly Calculator."
>
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto w-full min-h-screen px-4 py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col">
    
    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="animate-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[var(--theme-text-main)] mb-4" style="opacity: 0;">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-reveal delay-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] font-medium" style="opacity: 0;">
        Effective Date: June 15, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col gap-8">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          By accessing and using the EV Kelly Calculator ("the Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. If you do not agree to abide by these terms, please do not use this Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] tracking-tight">2. Strict Educational Purposes & Not Financial Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The mathematical projections, position sizing outputs, and data provided by the EV Kelly Calculator are for <strong>educational and informational purposes only</strong>. We are not registered financial advisors, brokers, or dealers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Nothing contained on this website constitutes investment advice, financial advice, trading advice, or any other sort of advice. You should not treat any of the Service's outputs as a definitive call to action. Trading in financial markets (including equities, forex, and cryptocurrency) involves a high degree of risk and may result in the total loss of your capital.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis. While we strive for mathematical accuracy, we make no guarantees regarding the reliability, accuracy, or completeness of the calculator's outputs. The tool operates under theoretical assumptions (such as zero slippage and static probability) which do not reflect real-world market stochastic variance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Under no circumstances shall EV Kelly Calculator, its developers, or affiliates be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising out of or in any way connected with your access to or use of the Service. You assume total responsibility and risk for your execution of trades in live markets based on the parameters generated by this tool.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          All content, visual interfaces, graphics, design, compilation, and code used to operate the Service are the property of EV Kelly Calculator and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not copy, reproduce, or distribute the underlying code or design structure without explicit permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace these Terms at any time. It is your responsibility to check this page periodically for changes. Your continued use of the Service following the posting of any changes to these Terms constitutes acceptance of those changes.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>